{"title": "Blind Immunity", "pageid": 28132, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Blind_Immunity", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Blind Immunity</b> is a passive feature that prevents the wielder from being blinded.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wearer cannot be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blinded</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shar%27s_Spear_of_Evening\" title=\"Shar's Spear of Evening\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shar%27s_Spear_of_Evening\" title=\"Shar's Spear of Evening\">Shar's Spear of Evening</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eversight_Ring\" title=\"Eversight Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Ring_I_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Eversight_Ring\" title=\"Eversight Ring\">Eversight Ring</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Helmet\" title=\"Helldusk Helmet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Helmet\" title=\"Helldusk Helmet\">Helldusk Helmet</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Steelwatcher_Helmet\" title=\"Steelwatcher Helmet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Steelwatcher_Helmet\" title=\"Steelwatcher Helmet\">Steelwatcher Helmet</a> provide similar immunity to blindness; however, only the latter allows the wearer to see through <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_(cloud)\" title=\"Darkness (cloud)\">magical darkness</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Despite not stating such in the description, Blind Immunity also allows the wearer to see through magical darkness.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202814\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2235/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21539/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6379/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 967309/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   58.080      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   58.080      1 -total\n 34.58%   20.085      4 Template:Item_icon\n 24.20%   14.056      1 Template:Cond\n 23.04%   13.384      2 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 21.59%   12.537      2 Template:MdRarityItem\n 20.62%   11.978      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 20.31%   11.795      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 19.22%   11.161     26 Template:Trim\n 17.48%   10.152      9 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28132-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202814 and revision id 377064. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}